{"id":"432469","name":"白萝卜玉米猪尾汤","author":"尔东叶","authorId":"6100832","desc":"","cover":"images/432469/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"100g"},{"name":"玉米","amount":"100g"},{"name":"猪尾","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"味精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"大料","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪尾洗干净，用冷水浸泡15分钟。","img":"images/432469/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"玉米切成段。","img":"images/432469/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"猪尾切成段入锅焯水。","img":"images/432469/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮锅加葱姜大料香叶。","img":"images/432469/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"焯水后的猪尾入锅加适量开水盖上锅盖煮。","img":"images/432469/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"分钟后，玉米入锅同煮。","img":"images/432469/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"分钟后，白萝卜洗干净切成滚刀块，入锅同煮。","img":"images/432469/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮至食材熟，加盐、味精。","img":"images/432469/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"食材入味加胡椒粉。关火。","img":"images/432469/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"撒上香菜","img":"images/432469/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"盛出即可享用。","img":"images/432469/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"1、用文火煮汤。\n2、调味料依据个人口味添加。\n \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}